# Keep the build context small and deterministic.
#
# go.work is excluded deliberately: the Dockerfile sets GOWORK=off, but a
# workspace file inside the context is one more way for resolution to differ
# between your machine and the image.
go.work
go.work.sum

.git
.github
.githooks
docs
scripts
compose.yaml
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.sandbox
.dockerignore

# Test-only code and fixtures.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata

# Note: cmd/ is NOT excluded, because Dockerfile.sandbox needs it and both
# images share one build context. The gateway Dockerfile simply does not copy
# it, which is the part that matters for the gateway's image size.

*.md
LICENSE
NOTICE
coverage.out
cov.out
